 "nl": [
  "library must accept SMTP (TCP 25) from dmz-web.",
  "Allow partners to connect to mail using SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Hosts in cameras may reach admin over SMTP (TCP 25) and syslog (UDP 514).",
  "Allow cameras to connect to scada using SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "research offers NTP (UDP 123) and HTTPS (TCP 443) to every zone.",
  "Make HTTPS (TCP 443) and DNS over UDP 53 on scada reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Allow mail to connect to dev-lab using PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and SNMP (UDP 161) and SSH (TCP 22).",
  "voip is isolated: it may only reach library on syslog (UDP 514); cameras on NTP (UDP 123), and nothing else.",
  "Hosts in dns-servers may reach edge-cache over RDP (TCP 3389) and SMB (TCP 445).",
  "dns-servers must accept SMB (TCP 445) from scada.",
  "Hosts in nvr may reach dev-lab over SMB (TCP 445).",
  "Apart from edge-cache on syslog (UDP 514), all traffic originating in mail must be dropped.",
  "edge-cache must accept SMTP (TCP 25) and MySQL (TCP 3306) from library.",
  "Allow dmz-web to connect to backup using PostgreSQL (TCP 5432).",
  "No packet from backup may enter hr, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Permit TCP ports 1024-65535 from cameras to partners but deny MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "dev-lab must accept HTTP (TCP 80) and LDAP (TCP 389) and SSH (TCP 22) from research.",
  "library must never reach dmz-web, regardless of any other rule.",
  "ntp-servers must never reach voip, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Restrict ntp-servers so that its only permitted destinations are dev-lab on syslog (UDP 514); backup on DNS over UDP 53; drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "Permit any UDP port from edge-cache to nvr but deny SNMP (UDP 161), TFTP (UDP 69).",
  "No packet from nvr may enter edge-cache, even for services open to everyone.",
  "library must accept HTTPS (TCP 443) from edge-cache.",
  "Hosts in research may reach scada over MySQL (TCP 3306) and SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Hosts in partners may reach hr over SMB (TCP 445).",
  "Hosts in backup may reach dev-lab over SMTP (TCP 25) and DNS over UDP 53 and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "library offers NTP (UDP 123) and HTTP (TCP 80) to every zone.",
  "scada must never reach voip, regardless of any other rule.",
  "backup must never reach nvr, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Allow edge-cache to connect to scada using PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "research must accept SMTP (TCP 25) from dev-lab."
 ],
